    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENG303 · Assessment 2/8</span>\n<h2>Mini project 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13756 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENG303 · Đầu điểm 2/8</span>\n<h2>Mini project 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13756 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">N/A</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">*Option 1:<br>Students work in a group of 5:<br>- Each group contacts lecturers of ENT/TRS classes, BEN's writing classes (EAW, ERW, ENB) or ENM classes to ask for 3 pieces of writing (paragraphs, essays or emails) in which grammatical errors are largely present.<br>- Each member in a group is in charge of identifying any grammatical errors in the 3 pieces of writing obtained.<br>- Each group writes a booklet for EFL learners. In the booklet, they select the most common grammatical errors (at least 5) from the pieces of writing, put forward suggestions on how to avoid them, and design some exercises to help the readers practice writing sentences/paragraphs with the relevant grammatical structures.<br>- The groups send their booklets to the lecturer in charge for marking and give a presentation on how they have worked on the booklet in class for feedback.<br>- The lecturer in charge can invite other lecturers to come to the class, and the groups can pitch the booklet to them.<br><br>*Students are encouraged to use AI tools to assist with this project. Any use of AI tools must be clearly documented in the project report submitted to the lecturer. Potential uses include:<br>+ Error Identification: Students can first identify grammatical errors manually and then use AI tools to perform the same task. This allows them to compare their own findings with the AI's suggestions.<br>+ Researching Explanations: They can use AI tools to find reliable materials that come with grammatical explanations, which will help them write the section on how to avoid common errors.<br>+ Designing Exercises: They can use AI tools to generate draft exercises for the booklet, which they must then review and adjust for suitability and accuracy.<br>+ Other Purposes.<br><br>*Option 2: Lecturer’s choice</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">written report + presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Demonstrates the knowledge which students have obtained from the delivered chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Submitted in class or through Google Drive</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Instructions and schedules for the mini project must be presented in the course implementation plan approved by the head of the department.<br><br>Instructors are responsible for informing students about the project at the beginning of the course and reviewing them after grading.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 49 — Project - Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Session 50 — Project - Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Session 51 — Project - Presentation &amp; Feedback</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 49 — Project - Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Buổi 50 — Project - Presentation &amp; Feedback</li><li>Buổi 51 — Project - Presentation &amp; Feedback</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
